#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide opensuse-leap-16-0
#: opensuse-tumbleweed
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "The B<strstr()> function finds the first occurrence of the substring "
#| "I<needle> in the string I<haystack>.  The terminating `\\e0' characters "
#| "are not compared."
msgid ""
"The B<strstr>()  function finds the first occurrence of the substring "
"I<needle> in the string I<haystack>.  The terminating null bytes "
"(\\[aq]\\[rs]0\\[aq]) are not compared."
msgstr ""
"A função B<strstr()> encontra a primeira ocorrência da subsequência "
"I<agulha> na sequência I<palheiro>. Os caracteres terminadores `\\e0' não "
"são comparados."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"The B<strcasestr>()  function is like B<strstr>(), but ignores the case of "
"both arguments."
msgstr ""

#. type: SH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "RETURN VALUE"
msgstr "VALOR DE RETORNO"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "The B<strstr()> function returns a pointer to the beginning of the "
#| "substring, or NULL if the substring is not found."
msgid ""
"These functions return a pointer to the beginning of the located substring, "
"or NULL if the substring is not found."
msgstr ""
"A função B<strstr()> retorna um ponteiro para o início da subsequência, ou "
"NULL se a subsequência não for encontrada."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"If I<needle> is the empty string, the return value is always I<haystack> "
"itself."
msgstr ""

